    "project": "research/function_divisor_finiteness_audit_20261115/lean",
    "theorem": "FunctionDivisorFinitenessAudit.function_divisor_finiteness_certificate",
    "statement": "theorem function_divisor_finiteness_certificate : (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) (f : W.FunctionField) (hf : f ≠ 0), (Function.support (pointOrder W f)).Finite ∧ (∀ R : W.Point, functionDivisor W f hf R = pointOrder W f R) ∧ functionDivisor W f hf ∈ principalPointDivisors W) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) (f g : W.FunctionField) (hf : f ≠ 0) (hg : g ≠ 0), functionDivisor W (f * g) (mul_ne_zero hf hg) = functionDivisor W f hf + functionDivisor W g hg ∧ functionDivisor W (f / g) (div_ne_zero hf hg) = functionDivisor W f hf - functionDivisor W g hg) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [DecidableEq K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) (P : W.Point) (n : ℕ), functionDivisor W (millerFunction W P n) (miller_function_nonzero W P n) = millerDivisor W P n) ∧ rationalCurve.Δ ≠ 0 ∧ rationalFunction ≠ 0 ∧ (∀ c : F3, rationalFunction ≠ constantHom rationalCurve c) ∧ functionDivisor rationalCurve rationalFunction rational_function_nonzero = 0 ∧ InfinityMonic rationalCurve rationalFunction",
    "decl_sha256": "f4c0c971036efced202ba6da453857cdaaaa70f6e116619f5839ce5d10ad1b1b",
    "scope": "Actual every-nonzero-function divisor finiteness and additive principal point-divisor homomorphism for every field/general Weierstrass model, derived rather than assumed. Actual coordinate-ring evaluation zero implies root of its actual algebra norm polynomial; actual norm nonzero, polynomial-root set finite and monic quadratic yfibers finite. Actual point coordinate injection/finite unions/images/preimages derive finite affine zero sets. Actual nonvanishing evaluation gives a unit in the actual derived local DVR and actual official adic value1. Every actual FunctionField fraction therefore has all nonzero actual normalized point orders in finite numerator zeros/denominator zeros/infinity. General finite-support Finsupp principal point divisors, product/quotient rules, actual rational-function-unit-group additive homomorphism/principal subgroup range and compatibility with actual all-n Miller functions proved. Actual F3 curve y²=x³+x+1 has nonzero discriminant; actual rational function (X²+1)/(X²+X+2) nonzero/nonconstant by injective actual polynomial-function map and coefficient comparison. It has zero actual local order at every F3-rational nonsingular point including infinity, zero rational-point divisor and actual leading-residue-one normalization. This refutes zero-rational-point-divisor implies constant after deleting geometric-point scope; the source uses bar-k geometric points and is not refuted. Thirty-nine modules include33exactcredited cores+6new; defaults/standardfoundations. Over arbitraryK actual nonsingularKpoint divisors; ifKalgclosed and W elliptic all geometricpoints. Source qualified Theorem7.7.1 survives. General geometric degreezero, globalconstantkernel/uniqueness, algebraicclosurebasechange, MathlibScheme.localRing/Divisor APIinterop, translation/reciprocity/isogeny/Lang/Cartier/Jacobian/canonicalWeil-Tate/MOVFR/full14 remainopen. Samehost/prover/Mathlib, nativeheaderproceduralonly/notcompiler-parser-physicalhostrefinement. No novelty/canonicalpromotion/signedstandingclaim.",
